The three fixes of aquamarine-wayland-nested.patch (see there for the explanation),
for the older layout of src/backend/Wayland.cpp, plus one that only the older
layout needs:

4. Idle callbacks only run at the end of dispatchEvents(), from a loop that walks
   the list while callbacks append to it. The loop now works on a copy, also runs
   what the callbacks queued, and flushes afterwards. Without this the deferred
   size from fix 2 crashes Hyprland or is never delivered.

Written against aquamarine 0.10.0.

--- a/src/backend/Wayland.cpp
+++ b/src/backend/Wayland.cpp
@@ -97,15 +97,15 @@
 
